{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13639","headline":"奉和独孤中丞游云门寺 · 严维","name":"奉和独孤中丞游云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝壑开花界，耶溪极上源。\n光辉三独坐，登陟五云门。\n深木鸣驺驭，晴山曜武贲。\n乱泉观坐卧，疎磬发朝昏。\n苍翠新秋色，莓苔积雨痕。\n上方看度鸟，後夜听吟猿。\n异迹焚香对，新诗酌茗论。\n归来还抚俗，诸老莫攀辕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}